translationMismatchBody:
Some game files are not the expected ones (they may be from another version, be damaged or have been replaced by a translation copied by hand):

{{problems}}{{more}}

Fix: uninstall other mods that change these files and, on Steam, use Properties > Installed Files > Verify integrity of game files (in GOG Galaxy: Manage installation > Verify / Repair). Then install the translation again.

conflictBody:
These mods only work in ScummVM:
{{scummvm}}

These only work in the original game (game.exe):
{{original}}{{compatible}}

Choose a combination. The mods left out are disabled (you can enable them again on the Mods page).

removeScummvmBody:
This deletes:
- the ScummVM that Vortex downloaded: {{dir}}
- the helper folder ScummVM uses to open the translated game (it only contains links to the game files, which are not touched): {{shadow}}
- the "The Longest Journey (Vortex)" entry in the ScummVM game list

Your saved games are not deleted. They stay in {{saves}}.
If you enable a ScummVM mod again later, Vortex will offer to download ScummVM again.

convertSavesDone:
Saved games converted to ScummVM: {{count}}. They are in the ScummVM saves folder:
{{dir}}

In ScummVM they keep the names they have in the original game and start one empty page after your last ScummVM save (the first one is {{first}}). The original saves were not changed and still work in the original game.
